# mixed tracked/untracked HDL-codegen variant dirs (s1_rtl_pad/padinj/txfix carry
# a handful of tracked source files; everything else in them is regenerable sim
# output). /** excludes CONTENTS only; every intermediate dir on the path to a
# tracked file needs its own negation too, or git won't descend to find it.
# sp3 task 2 (model-backport): make_sro_trees.sh --from-regen generates these
# fixctl-forcing wrapper copies next to their originals; derived, never tracked.
